WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.270
- How did your life story though,

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.640
end up becoming a part of a movie.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.760
'Cause this wasn't your idea, right?

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.010
- No.

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:08.277
So many years ago Barry Diller,

00:00:08.277 --> 00:00:11.020
at the time who owned HSN
home shopping network.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.630
And you know, he bought my company.

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:16.820
He just went from one QVC to HSN and said,

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.779
Joy, you're coming with me.

00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:18.612
That's it!

00:00:18.612 --> 00:00:19.445
I'm buying your company.

00:00:19.445 --> 00:00:20.278
You can't say no.

00:00:20.278 --> 00:00:22.350
So that was one time I didn't say no.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.996
So nonetheless, he asked me to go out

00:00:24.996 --> 00:00:27.829
and film a show for him in Hollywood.

00:00:27.829 --> 00:00:30.080
And we went out to dinner
with the producers,

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.830
prominent producer and I
dunno what got me started.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.483
He started asking me a lot
of questions about my life.

00:00:35.483 --> 00:00:37.150
This is many years ago.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:40.720
And I stood up and said
goodnight and he said,

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.260
Joy, one day I'm gonna write your movie.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.520
It is an amazing story.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.353
And I laughed.

00:00:45.353 --> 00:00:46.186
I said, oh.

00:00:46.186 --> 00:00:47.110
That's great.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.450
A few years later I'm
sitting in my office,

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:51.229
the phone rings and Ken says,

00:00:51.229 --> 00:00:54.490
Hey Joy, I'm in my office with
this producer and this guy

00:00:55.585 --> 00:00:59.090
and we're gonna make a
movie out of your life.

00:00:59.090 --> 00:00:59.923
And I'm like,

00:00:59.923 --> 00:01:00.756
okay!

00:01:00.756 --> 00:01:01.589
Great Ken.

00:01:01.589 --> 00:01:02.559
I'll talk to you next week.

00:01:02.559 --> 00:01:03.392
(Joy laughs)

00:01:03.392 --> 00:01:06.290
And P.S. you know David O. Russell,

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.930
I mean a family in Hollywood
to meet Jennifer and

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.970
Bradley Cooper and Robert de Niro and

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:15.040
David O. Russell and Diane Ladd.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:15.873
That's just great.

00:01:15.873 --> 00:01:17.370
- [Kelly] Didn't you kinda
start to be terrified,

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.170
Cause you're like, my life
is gonna be in a film.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:20.550
It would terrify me.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:21.383
- I know.

00:01:21.383 --> 00:01:23.820
Really, I have faith in people in general.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.613
I had such faith in David.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.808
He called me at dinner time sometimes.

00:01:29.808 --> 00:01:32.210
And it would be like 2
o'clock in the morning.

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.470
And he'd still be,

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:36.670
you know talking to me and
asking about parts of my life.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:37.980
- It's cause he lives here
and no one shuts off here.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:38.813
- There you go.

00:01:38.813 --> 00:01:39.646
- Go ahead.

00:01:39.646 --> 00:01:40.479
- Right, exactly.

00:01:40.479 --> 00:01:41.810
So, when they went away to film it,

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.583
you know, he came back
with a five-hour movie.

00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:47.240
So it really didn't even get into

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.360
all the obstacles in my life.

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:50.570
It was really amazing.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:51.403
It was amazing.

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:52.780
- So, what we're seeing
is like a synopsis.

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:54.320
- [Joy] I know right,
it really was extended.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:55.153
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:01:55.153 --> 00:01:56.260
I know, I want the extended release.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.890
- Yeah there you go.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.230
So tell us about the new
show, America's Big Deal.

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:01.063
- Oh my goodness.

00:02:01.063 --> 00:02:02.810
Well, we are so excited.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.050
Thursday nights on USA network.

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:08.250
And this really is a game changer.

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:11.980
It's the first time ever,
shoppable TV competition.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.160
- Yeah.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:16.230
So entrepreneurs and small businesses,

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.690
you know over 90% of them
makeup the firms across America.

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:22.130
I think they're the
engine in this country.

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:25.200
And you know through this
last year and a half,

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.600
I said I really have to do something.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.490
So the mission of this show is to

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.540
bring back small businesses
and entrepreneurs.

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:38.290
So they get this amazing
stage to pitch their products.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:42.640
They're ready to sell products
and they get to pitch them.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.273
We see the backstory and
how they've been impacted.

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:49.500
So the audience, the viewer

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.520
becomes the consumer becomes the buyer.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.340
So you literally can sit there and

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.770
buy the product when you see it.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.070
And let me tell you,

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.110
you're gonna be like,

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.800
how did this not exist
before or I have to have it.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:01.633
Get your holiday list out.

00:03:01.633 --> 00:03:02.466
- Or you're gonna be mad and you're like,

00:03:02.466 --> 00:03:03.580
why didn't I think of it?

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:06.972
- And it's gonna be at a big deal price.

00:03:06.972 --> 00:03:10.360
It's gonna be amazing and it's live.

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.714
So it's right there in the moment, right?

00:03:12.714 --> 00:03:14.920
We're gonna have a million surprises.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.560
And then, if that's not
enough that they get this

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.510
stage in front of America,

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.570
the person who sells the most
dollars of their product,

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:26.660
turns around and gets
to face retail titans,

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:27.950
national retail titans.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:31.270
So Lowe's, Macy's and
I will be on the panel

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.727
for QVC and HSN.

00:03:32.727 --> 00:03:36.650
And they will be offered a six figure deal

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.347
to put their product nationwide.

00:03:38.347 --> 00:03:39.656
(audience claps)

00:03:39.656 --> 00:03:40.718
So it's amazing.

00:03:40.718 --> 00:03:41.551
It's amazing.

